post.description:
Create new activity template or variant.

Auto-variant logic:
- If template name exists with different content → creates new variant
- If same content already exists → returns existing (idempotent)
- If new template → creates first variant (generation 0)

Request Body:
{
  "name": "Template Name",
  "category": "feature",  # Optional, defaults to template name
  "description": "What this template does",
  "task_steps": [
    {
      "id": "task-1",
      "subagent": "general",
      "description": "Task description",
      "dependencies": [],
      "prompt": {
        "template": "Task prompt with {{variables}}",
        "max_tokens": 8000,
        "compression_strategy": "filter",
        "variables": ["variable1"]
      },
      "validation": {
        "required_files": [],
        "required_patterns": [],
        "forbidden_patterns": [],
        "commands": []
      },
      "retry": {
        "max_attempts": 3,
        "strategy": "simple",
        "fallback_prompt": ""
      },
      "metrics": {},
      "tools": {
        "required": ["read", "write"],
        "optional": ["bash"],
        "disabled": []
      }
    }
  ],
  "variables": {},  # Optional
  "context_requirements": []  # Optional
}

Returns:
{
  "variant_id": "template-name-a1b2c3d4",
  "activity_id": "template-name",
  "genealogy": {
    "content_hash": "a1b2c3d4",
    "parent_hash": null,  # or parent hash if variant
    "generation": 0  # or N+1 if variant
  },
  ...
}

Create new variant of existing template.

This endpoint is for explicit variant creation (e.g., from CLI derive_template).
Most variants are created automatically via POST /templates with duplicate names.

Request Body:
{
  "reason": "Why this variant exists",
  "changes": {
    "tasks": [...],  # Modified task steps
    "description": "..."  # Updated description
  },
  "source": "agent-proposed",  # Optional
  "metadata": {}  # Optional
}

Returns:
{
  "variant_id": "template-name-e5f6g7h8",
  "genealogy": {
    "parent_hash": "a1b2c3d4",
    "generation": 1
  },
  ...
}

